(6869725, 1034954, 127021, '<td valign="top">my top pick for creative lighting and a good idea in general.  original.  while there are some minor technical flaws IMO they actually contribute positively to the final image.  congrats</td>', 'my top pick for creative lighting and a good idea in general.  original.  while there are some minor technical flaws IMO they actually contribute positively to the final image.  congrats', '2012-09-26 05:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6869803, 1034939, 142473, '<td valign="top">Great abstract quality.  Would make a really interesting canvas print I think.<br/> <br/>Only thing I''m not totally a fan of is the pink hue.  A light blue filter overlay might have been able to get rid of some of that.</td>', 'Great abstract quality.  Would make a really interesting canvas print I think. Only thing I''m not totally a fan of is the pink hue.  A light blue filter overlay might have been able to get rid of some of that.', '2012-09-26 09:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
