(6870133, 1034949, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Like the composition. Something seems off about the color, though.</td>', 'Nice idea. Like the composition. Something seems off about the color, though.', '2012-09-26 22:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6870135, 1034351, 16488, '<td valign="top">Great concept! But...I think the subject is a little lost in the atmospherics.</td>', 'Great concept! But...I think the subject is a little lost in the atmospherics.', '2012-09-26 22:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6870136, 1034968, 16488, '<td valign="top">The rings make sense and have their own visual appeal. I don''t get the rest of it, though...not sure what they are resting on or the importance of the blurry white bit on the left.</td>', 'The rings make sense and have their own visual appeal. I don''t get the rest of it, though...not sure what they are resting on or the importance of the blurry white bit on the left.', '2012-09-26 22:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6870137, 1034971, 16488, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title. Is that water behind and this is a part of the unseen bridge?</td>', 'I don''t get the title. Is that water behind and this is a part of the unseen bridge?', '2012-09-26 22:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6870138, 1034684, 16488, '<td valign="top">Like the concept and the overall execution is good. For me the spoon detracts...but then I don''t eat my spaghetti with more than a fork. I think it''s the reflection mostly and the static placement of the spoon that takes away from the rest.</td>', 'Like the concept and the overall execution is good. For me the spoon detracts...but then I don''t eat my spaghetti with more than a fork. I think it''s the reflection mostly and the static placement of the spoon that takes away from the rest.', '2012-09-26 22:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6870167, 1034727, 96815, '<td valign="top">This one actually has an optical illusion that the pliers are rotating when I scroll the image up and down! Maybe it''s just me, but awesome!</td>', 'This one actually has an optical illusion that the pliers are rotating when I scroll the image up and down! Maybe it''s just me, but awesome!', '2012-09-26 23:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6870181, 1034783, 23484, '<td valign="top">Cool.</td>', 'Cool.', '2012-09-27 00:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6870202, 1034541, 97225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and pov, beautiful patterns, brilliant exposure. Should be a ribbon here.</td>', 'Wonderful composition and pov, beautiful patterns, brilliant exposure. Should be a ribbon here.', '2012-09-27 01:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6870204, 1034966, 97225, '<td valign="top">Love the different textures and the way the metals and reflections play together. Top 3.</td>', 'Love the different textures and the way the metals and reflections play together. Top 3.', '2012-09-27 01:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6870205, 1034970, 97225, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great shot and an historical one, too.</td>', 'Wow! Great shot and an historical one, too.', '2012-09-27 02:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6870206, 1034476, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lit, wonderful patterns.</td>', 'Beautifully lit, wonderful patterns.', '2012-09-27 02:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6870225, 1034557, 143064, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful photograph</td>', 'This is a wonderful photograph', '2012-09-27 02:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6870229, 1034476, 141826, '<td valign="top">Simply amazing.... 10+!!!!</td>', 'Simply amazing.... 10+!!!!', '2012-09-27 03:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6870264, 1034893, 93565, '<td valign="top">Definitely would''ve liked to have DoF through the entire shot here. There''s not any single object that we should pay more attention to, so having depth through the whole thing would let us further revel in the variety of coins you''ve got here. As a setup shot, this shouldn''t pose a problem to accomplish, either, since your subject isn''t moving.</td>', 'Definitely would''ve liked to have DoF through the entire shot here. There''s not any single object that we should pay more attention to, so having depth through the whole thing would let us further revel in the variety of coins you''ve got here. As a setup shot, this shouldn''t pose a problem to accomplish, either, since your subject isn''t moving.', '2012-09-27 07:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6870265, 1034585, 93565, '<td valign="top">As a very distinctly stock type shot, I''d very much recommend you clean up the scratches on the spoon.</td>', 'As a very distinctly stock type shot, I''d very much recommend you clean up the scratches on the spoon.', '2012-09-27 07:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6870266, 1034641, 93565, '<td valign="top">A simple scene, but very interesting. The plants look blurred in a bit of an odd way, somehow, but I like it. Good shot.</td>', 'A simple scene, but very interesting. The plants look blurred in a bit of an odd way, somehow, but I like it. Good shot.', '2012-09-27 07:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6870267, 1034833, 93565, '<td valign="top">Great in its simplicity. Weathered without trying to bludgeon us with sharpness. Great shot.</td>', 'Great in its simplicity. Weathered without trying to bludgeon us with sharpness. Great shot.', '2012-09-27 07:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6870269, 1034380, 93565, '<td valign="top">I think you need to decide on this entry whether you want to have the subject be the photographer or the motorcycle. As it is, they are both very prominent and do battle. Are we being shown the photographer, a portrait of one''s self? Or are we being given a shot of a motorcycle which we should find beautiful or attractive? Once that distinction of intent is made, you can change your direction accordingly.</td>', 'I think you need to decide on this entry whether you want to have the subject be the photographer or the motorcycle. As it is, they are both very prominent and do battle. Are we being shown the photographer, a portrait of one''s self? Or are we being given a shot of a motorcycle which we should find beautiful or attractive? Once that distinction of intent is made, you can change your direction accordingly.', '2012-09-27 07:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6870271, 1034968, 93565, '<td valign="top">I like the symmetry- wish it was more complete so far as the background goes, but this is done well otherwise.</td>', 'I like the symmetry- wish it was more complete so far as the background goes, but this is done well otherwise.', '2012-09-27 07:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6870274, 1034643, 93565, '<td valign="top">I like the distortion. This almost looks like a pencil drawing.</td>', 'I like the distortion. This almost looks like a pencil drawing.', '2012-09-27 07:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6870422, 1034663, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject and composition. But the background is a bit busy and I think the processing makes the metal look a bit too much like plastic.</td>', 'Interesting subject and composition. But the background is a bit busy and I think the processing makes the metal look a bit too much like plastic.', '2012-09-27 12:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6870425, 1034551, 16488, '<td valign="top">I like the intended subject and exposure but the composition seems to put the emphasis on the words and numbers (rather than the spike and rail) making the print the subject.</td>', 'I like the intended subject and exposure but the composition seems to put the emphasis on the words and numbers (rather than the spike and rail) making the print the subject.', '2012-09-27 12:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6870477, 1034683, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great idea and great composition.</td>', 'Great idea and great composition.', '2012-09-27 13:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6870478, 1034995, 23484, '<td valign="top">Love the grain.</td>', 'Love the grain.', '2012-09-27 13:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
